---
// Above-the-fold hero band. Eyebrow + H1 + sub-H1 + dual audience CTAs.
// Copy: docs/growth/copy/hero.md ("Hero band").
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="dot-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div
    class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 pt-20 pb-24 md:px-10 md:pt-28 md:pb-32 lg:pt-36 lg:pb-44"
  >
    <p
      class="text-lg md:text-xl text-[var(--text-muted)] mb-8 md:mb-12"
    >
      Universal Luminaire Cutsheet · Open standard
    </p>

    <h1
      class="hero-display max-w-5xl text-balance break-words font-display font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--text)] text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl leading-[1.05]"
    >
      Luminaire datasheets were built for people to read, not for the AI now doing the reading.
    </h1>

    <p
      class="mt-6 md:mt-8 max-w-3xl text-lg md:text-xl text-[var(--text-muted)] leading-relaxed"
    >
      ULC is the open, machine-readable standard for luminaire cutsheets: one structured record design tools and AI read directly, published alongside the PDF, IES, and LDT files manufacturers already make.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 md:mt-12 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 sm:gap-5">
      <a
        href="/for-designers"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-[var(--accent-warm)] px-6 py-3.5 min-h-[44px] text-base font-semibold text-[var(--on-accent)] hover:bg-[var(--accent-warm-deep)] transition-colors w-full sm:w-auto"
      >
        I'm a designer
        <svg
          aria-hidden="true"
          width="18"
          height="18"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
        >
          <path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>
      <a
        href="/for-manufacturers"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-[var(--accent-warm)] px-6 py-3.5 min-h-[44px] text-base font-semibold text-[var(--accent-warm)] hover:bg-[var(--accent-warm)] hover:text-[var(--on-accent)] transition-colors w-full sm:w-auto"
      >
        I'm a manufacturer
        <svg
          aria-hidden="true"
          width="18"
          height="18"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
        >
          <path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
